// Claude Code Manager - terminal focus keybindings (BUILD 2026-07-10 09:04 v14 close-guard).
// Merge into your VS Code keybindings.json. install.ps1 does it for you (with a backup).
//
// Goal: the caret should land on the prompt line of the session you moved to,
// without a second click. Focus is singular, so this needs two different keys:
//
//   * You are IN the tab list (you clicked it): a bare arrow moves AND enters.
//     `list.select` fires the list's onDidOpen handler, which calls
//     setActiveInstance() and focuses the terminal. `terminal.focus` is appended
//     because onDidOpen honours preserveFocus and may skip the focus call.
//     After this the list no longer has focus - that is the point.
//
//   * You are IN a terminal: Ctrl+Arrow OR Alt+Arrow switches session and never
//     leaves the prompt line. Both modifiers are bound to the same command so
//     muscle memory cannot miss. Ctrl+Arrow overrides the default
//     scrollToPreviousCommand / scrollToNextCommand, a shell-integration feature
//     that does nothing useful inside Claude Code's fullscreen TUI. Alt+Arrow was
//     unbound in the terminal, so it costs nothing.
//
// Why these keys reach VS Code at all: a keypress in a terminal is forwarded to
// the shell UNLESS the command it resolves to is listed in the default
// `terminal.integrated.commandsToSkipShell` (159 entries). Verified in the 1.128
// bundle: focusNext and focusPrevious are both on that list. A command that is
// NOT on it - e.g. `runCommands` - must therefore never be bound to a key whose
// `when` can be true while the terminal has focus, or the keystroke is swallowed.
//
// FYI, VS Code already ships Ctrl+PageDown / Ctrl+PageUp for the same two
// commands (default `primary: 2060` = 2048 Ctrl | 12 PageDown). Left untouched.
//
// A single click on a tab is handled by settings, not here:
//   "terminal.integrated.tabs.focusMode": "singleClick"
[
  {
    "key": "ctrl+down",
    "command": "workbench.action.terminal.focusNext",
    "when": "terminalFocus && !terminalTabsFocus"
  },
  {
    "key": "ctrl+up",
    "command": "workbench.action.terminal.focusPrevious",
    "when": "terminalFocus && !terminalTabsFocus"
  },
  {
    "key": "alt+down",
    "command": "workbench.action.terminal.focusNext",
    "when": "terminalFocus && !terminalTabsFocus"
  },
  {
    "key": "alt+up",
    "command": "workbench.action.terminal.focusPrevious",
    "when": "terminalFocus && !terminalTabsFocus"
  },
  {
    "key": "down",
    "command": "runCommands",
    "args": {
      "commands": ["list.focusDown", "list.select", "workbench.action.terminal.focus"]
    },
    "when": "terminalTabsFocus"
  },
  {
    "key": "up",
    "command": "runCommands",
    "args": {
      "commands": ["list.focusUp", "list.select", "workbench.action.terminal.focus"]
    },
    "when": "terminalTabsFocus"
  }
]
